---
# /loom/shortcuts/ — where a new subscriber to the LOOM email list lands.
#
# Buttondown's free plan sends its own generic welcome email and does not let it be edited, so the
# list's promise (the keyboard shortcuts PDF and the MIDI controller layout PDFs) is kept here instead: Buttondown's Settings →
# Subscribing → "After confirming" redirects every confirmed subscriber to this page. If the list
# moves to a paid plan with a custom welcome email, this page can stay as that email's link.
#
# The PDFs and their cover images live in /assets/loom/. The covers are page 1 of each PDF,
# rendered with pdftoppm at 110 dpi; re-render them when the PDFs change.
#
# The MIDI controller layout PDFs and their covers live in /assets/loom/midi-layouts/. They are
# built in the LOOM repo (docs/marketing/midi-layouts/<controller>/out/); each cover is that
# folder's 01-cover.png as an 800 px WebP (cwebp -q 80 -resize 800 0). Copy both again when a
# sheet changes.
#
# noindex: it is a thank-you page, not something a search should land on cold.
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /loom/shortcuts/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
title: "Your LOOM downloads"
seoTitle: "Your LOOM Downloads"
description: "Your LOOM downloads: the keyboard shortcuts PDF, in a light version for printing and a dark one for your screen, and MIDI controller layouts for four controllers."
robots: "noindex, follow"
ownFooter: true
faviconSvg: /assets/loom/loom-favicon.svg
favicon16: /assets/loom/favicon-16.png
favicon: /assets/loom/favicon-32.png
---
<style>
  {% include "components/loom-fonts.njk" %}

  html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #0B0C0E; }
  body { font-family: Archivo, "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #E8EAED; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  a { color: #4CC9F0; text-decoration: none; }
  a:hover { color: #8AD9F5; text-decoration: underline; }
  *:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #7FDBFF; outline-offset: 2px; }
  img { max-width: 100%; display: block; }

  .sc-wrap { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px; }
  .sc-mono { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace; }
  .sc-label { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 11.5px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: #8A9099; }

  .sc-bar { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 10; background: rgba(11,12,14,0.92); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); border-bottom: 1px solid #23262C; }
  .sc-bar .sc-wrap { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding-top: 14px; padding-bottom: 14px; }
  .sc-bar img { width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 7px; }
  .sc-bar .sc-name { font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: #E8EAED; }
  .sc-bar .sc-back { margin-left: auto; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.13em; color: #C7CDD4; }

  .sc-hero { padding: 88px 0 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px; }
  .sc-eyebrow { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
  .sc-dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 2px; background: #35D07F; flex: none; }
  .sc-hero h1 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.035em; line-height: 1; max-width: 14ch; text-wrap: balance; }
  .sc-hero p { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(17px, 1.8vw, 20px); line-height: 1.55; color: #C7CDD4; max-width: 56ch; text-wrap: pretty; }

  .sc-pdfs { padding: 56px 0 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(300px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
  .sc-pdf { border: 1px solid #2C3038; border-radius: 12px; background: #0F1114; padding: 24px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 132px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 22px; align-items: center; }
  .sc-pdf.sc-feature { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #12201A, #0F1114); }
  .sc-cover { border-radius: 4px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.45); border: 1px solid #2C3038; aspect-ratio: 612 / 792; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .sc-cover-wide { border-radius: 4px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.45); border: 1px solid #2C3038; aspect-ratio: 8 / 5; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .sc-layouts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .sc-layouts { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } }
  .sc-layout { border: 1px solid #2C3038; border-radius: 12px; background: #0F1114; padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
  .sc-layout h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .sc-layout p { margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: #8A9099; text-wrap: pretty; }
  .sc-layout .sc-spacer { flex: 1; min-height: 2px; }
  .sc-pdf-body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; min-width: 0; }
  .sc-pdf h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .sc-pdf p { margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: #8A9099; }
  .sc-btn { display: inline-block; margin-top: 6px; padding: 13px 20px; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.09em; }
  .sc-btn:hover { text-decoration: none; }
  .sc-btn-green { background: #35D07F; color: #08090B; }
  .sc-btn-green:hover { color: #08090B; background: #4BDB8E; }
  .sc-btn-ghost { background: #171A1F; border: 1px solid #2C3038; color: #E8EAED; }
  .sc-btn-ghost:hover { color: #E8EAED; border-color: #3A3F48; }

  .sc-section { padding: 96px 0 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 26px; }
  .sc-section h2.sc-h { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 40px); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.05; }

  .sc-keys { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
  @media (max-width: 960px) { .sc-keys { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
  @media (max-width: 520px) { .sc-keys { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } }
  .sc-key { border: 1px solid #23262C; border-radius: 10px; background: #0F1114; padding: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
  .sc-caps { display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center; min-height: 40px; }
  .sc-cap { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 40px; height: 40px; padding: 0 12px; box-sizing: border-box;
    border-radius: 7px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #23272E, #1A1D22); border: 1px solid #343944; border-bottom-width: 3px;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', -apple-system, monospace; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #E8EAED; }
  .sc-cap.sc-sym { font-family: -apple-system, "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif; font-size: 17px; }
  .sc-key-what { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .sc-key-why { font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #8A9099; margin-top: -8px; }

  .sc-next { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(320px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
  .sc-card { border: 1px solid #2C3038; border-radius: 12px; background: #0F1114; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
  .sc-card h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .sc-card p { margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #8A9099; text-wrap: pretty; }
  .sc-card .sc-spacer { flex: 1; min-height: 4px; }
  .sc-video { position: relative; display: block; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #23262C; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; }
  .sc-video img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .sc-play { position: absolute; left: 14px; bottom: 14px; width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(11,12,14,0.78); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .sc-play::after { content: ""; margin-left: 4px; border-left: 15px solid #E8EAED; border-top: 9px solid transparent; border-bottom: 9px solid transparent; }
  .sc-video:hover .sc-play { background: #35D07F; }
  .sc-video:hover .sc-play::after { border-left-color: #08090B; }

  .sc-note { padding: 96px 0 0; }
  .sc-note-inner { border-left: 3px solid #35D07F; padding: 6px 0 6px 24px; max-width: 62ch; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
  .sc-note p { margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #C7CDD4; }
  .sc-note .sc-sig { font-size: 15px; color: #8A9099; }

  .sc-foot { padding: 96px 0 0; }
  .sc-foot .sc-row { border-top: 1px solid #23262C; padding: 30px 0 56px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 22px; align-items: center; }
  .sc-foot img { width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 6px; }
  .sc-foot a { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11.5px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; }
  .sc-foot .sc-fill { flex: 1; min-width: 20px; }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .sc-wrap { padding: 0 16px; }
    .sc-hero { padding-top: 56px; }
    .sc-pdf { grid-template-columns: 96px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 16px; padding: 18px; }
    .sc-section, .sc-note, .sc-foot { padding-top: 72px; }
  }
</style>

<div class="sc-bar">
  <div class="sc-wrap">
    <img src="/assets/loom/loom-icon-64.png" alt="" width="30" height="30">
    <div class="sc-name">LOOM</div>
    <a class="sc-back" href="/loom/">LOOM HOME</a>
  </div>
</div>

<main id="main-content" class="sc-wrap">

  <div class="sc-hero">
    <div class="sc-eyebrow"><div class="sc-dot"></div><div class="sc-label">YOU’RE ON THE LIST</div></div>
    <h1>Here are your LOOM downloads.</h1>
    <p>The keyboard shortcuts, with every key LOOM answers to, and mapping sheets for four MIDI controllers. Print the light shortcuts and keep them by your rig, or keep the dark ones open on a second screen. Thanks for signing up.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="sc-pdfs">
    <div class="sc-pdf sc-feature">
      <a href="/assets/loom/LOOM-keyboard-shortcuts-light.pdf"><img class="sc-cover" src="/assets/loom/shortcuts-cover-light.webp" alt="Page 1 of the light version of the LOOM keyboard shortcuts" width="935" height="1210" loading="eager"></a>
      <div class="sc-pdf-body">
        <div class="sc-label" style="color:#35D07F;">LIGHT · FOR PRINTING</div>
        <h2>Print it</h2>
        <p>White pages, US Letter. Five pages, readable from a music stand.</p>
        <a class="sc-btn sc-btn-green" href="/assets/loom/LOOM-keyboard-shortcuts-light.pdf">DOWNLOAD PDF</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="sc-pdf">
      <a href="/assets/loom/LOOM-keyboard-shortcuts-dark.pdf"><img class="sc-cover" src="/assets/loom/shortcuts-cover-dark.webp" alt="Page 1 of the dark version of the LOOM keyboard shortcuts" width="935" height="1210" loading="eager"></a>
      <div class="sc-pdf-body">
        <div class="sc-label" style="color:#4CC9F0;">DARK · FOR YOUR SCREEN</div>
        <h2>Keep it open</h2>
        <p>The same five pages in LOOM’s own colours, easy on the eyes on a dark stage.</p>
        <a class="sc-btn sc-btn-ghost" href="/assets/loom/LOOM-keyboard-shortcuts-dark.pdf">DOWNLOAD PDF</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="sc-section" id="midi-layouts">
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;">
      <div class="sc-label">MIDI CONTROLLER LAYOUTS</div>
      <h2 class="sc-h">Map your controller.</h2>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#C7CDD4;max-width:60ch;">Each sheet shows every control on the panel labelled with what it does in LOOM, and lists the settings that make it work. Set your controller up from the sheet, then learn the controls in LOOM’s MIDI Mapping window.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sc-layouts">
      <div class="sc-layout">
        <a href="/assets/loom/midi-layouts/loom-keylab-mk2-layouts.pdf"><img class="sc-cover-wide" src="/assets/loom/midi-layouts/keylab-mk2-cover.webp" alt="Page 1 of the LOOM layouts for the Arturia KeyLab mkII" width="800" height="500" loading="lazy"></a>
        <h3>Arturia KeyLab mkII</h3>
        <p>Two layouts. One gives every track its own controls, and one follows the focus, with knobs 1 to 8 on the focused track's macros. A setup page lists the settings in Arturia's software and in LOOM.</p>
        <div class="sc-spacer"></div>
        <a class="sc-btn sc-btn-ghost" href="/assets/loom/midi-layouts/loom-keylab-mk2-layouts.pdf">DOWNLOAD PDF</a>
      </div>
      <div class="sc-layout">
        <a href="/assets/loom/midi-layouts/loom-launchkey-mk4-layouts.pdf"><img class="sc-cover-wide" src="/assets/loom/midi-layouts/launchkey-mk4-cover.webp" alt="Page 1 of the LOOM layouts for the Novation Launchkey MK4" width="800" height="500" loading="lazy"></a>
        <h3>Novation Launchkey MK4 (49/61 and 25/37)</h3>
        <p>One layout for the 49 and 61, with a fader for each track's level, and one for the 25 and 37, which have no faders. The knobs play the focused track's macros, and Play and Stop are learned as MIDI Start and Stop.</p>
        <div class="sc-spacer"></div>
        <a class="sc-btn sc-btn-ghost" href="/assets/loom/midi-layouts/loom-launchkey-mk4-layouts.pdf">DOWNLOAD PDF</a>
      </div>
      <div class="sc-layout">
        <a href="/assets/loom/midi-layouts/loom-nanokontrol2-layout.pdf"><img class="sc-cover-wide" src="/assets/loom/midi-layouts/nanokontrol2-cover.webp" alt="Page 1 of the LOOM layouts for the Korg nanoKONTROL2" width="800" height="500" loading="lazy"></a>
        <h3>Korg nanoKONTROL2</h3>
        <p>Eight strips, each working one track: the slider sets its level, S stops it, M mutes it and R is its ring button. The knobs play the focused track's macros.</p>
        <div class="sc-spacer"></div>
        <a class="sc-btn sc-btn-ghost" href="/assets/loom/midi-layouts/loom-nanokontrol2-layout.pdf">DOWNLOAD PDF</a>
      </div>
      <div class="sc-layout">
        <a href="/assets/loom/midi-layouts/loom-mc6-pro-layout.pdf"><img class="sc-cover-wide" src="/assets/loom/midi-layouts/mc6-pro-cover.webp" alt="Page 1 of the LOOM layouts for the Morningstar MC6 Pro" width="800" height="500" loading="lazy"></a>
        <h3>Morningstar MC6 Pro</h3>
        <p>Two pages of footswitches: one works the focused track, and one runs the song. An expression pedal plays MACRO 1 of whichever track has the focus.</p>
        <div class="sc-spacer"></div>
        <a class="sc-btn sc-btn-ghost" href="/assets/loom/midi-layouts/loom-mc6-pro-layout.pdf">DOWNLOAD PDF</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="sc-section">
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;">
      <div class="sc-label">IF YOU LEARN ONLY FOUR</div>
      <h2 class="sc-h">Start with these.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="sc-keys">
      <div class="sc-key">
        <div class="sc-caps"><span class="sc-cap">Space</span></div>
        <div class="sc-key-what">Do what the ring says</div>
        <div class="sc-key-why">Record, close the loop, overdub. The centre of the focused ring shows what the next press will do.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="sc-key">
        <div class="sc-caps"><span class="sc-cap sc-sym">⇧</span><span class="sc-cap">Return</span></div>
        <div class="sc-key-what">Perform from the top</div>
        <div class="sc-key-why">Plays the arrangement from bar 1, and the song presses the looper’s buttons for you.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="sc-key">
        <div class="sc-caps"><span class="sc-cap sc-sym">⌘</span><span class="sc-cap">.</span></div>
        <div class="sc-key-what">Stop everything</div>
        <div class="sc-key-why">Stops the transport and every track at once.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="sc-key">
        <div class="sc-caps"><span class="sc-cap sc-sym">⌘</span><span class="sc-cap">/</span></div>
        <div class="sc-key-what">Open the User Guide</div>
        <div class="sc-key-why">The full manual, as a PDF on your Mac. It opens with no internet.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="sc-section">
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;">
      <div class="sc-label">WHAT TO DO NEXT</div>
      <h2 class="sc-h">Try it, then watch it.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="sc-next">
      <div class="sc-card">
        <div class="sc-label" style="color:#35D07F;">FREE FOR 14 DAYS</div>
        <h3>Haven’t tried LOOM yet?</h3>
        <p>The trial has every feature unlocked, with no watermark, no account and no card. When it ends, a licence is a one-time purchase.</p>
        <div class="sc-label" style="letter-spacing:0.06em;color:#6B7078;">{{ releases.latest.version }} · {{ releases.latest.dmgSize }} · APPLE SILICON · MACOS 13.3+</div>
        <div class="sc-spacer"></div>
        <a class="sc-btn sc-btn-green" href="{{ releases.latestDmgUrl }}">DOWNLOAD FOR MACOS</a>
      </div>
      <div class="sc-card">
        <div class="sc-label" style="color:#4CC9F0;">THE FULL OVERVIEW</div>
        <h3>See everything LOOM does</h3>
        <a class="sc-video" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=se70SNu-5nA" aria-label="Watch the LOOM full overview on YouTube">
          <img src="/assets/loom/overview-poster.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy">
          <span class="sc-play"></span>
        </a>
        <p>It’s long, but the chapters let you jump straight to the part you care about.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sc-card">
        <div class="sc-label" style="color:#F2B84B;">FREE TOUCHOSC LAYOUT</div>
        <h3>Play LOOM from an iPad</h3>
        <p>A TouchOSC layout with pads that show every track's state, and a mixer page for levels, sends, mutes and the click. The setup takes about five minutes.</p>
        <div class="sc-spacer"></div>
        <a class="sc-btn sc-btn-ghost" href="/loom/touchosc/">GET THE LAYOUT</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="sc-note">
    <div class="sc-note-inner">
      <p>I’m Zach. I’m an artist, producer, and software engineer in Nashville. I design and build LOOM with love for the art form of live looping. Feel free to reply to any email from this list, and I’ll see it.</p>
      <div class="sc-sig sc-mono">ZACH SWIFT · MOONQUAKE</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="sc-foot">
    <div class="sc-row">
      <img src="/assets/loom/loom-icon-64.png" alt="" width="26" height="26">
      <div class="sc-label" style="font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:0.12em;">LOOM · <a href="/" style="color:#8A9099;">MOONQUAKE</a></div>
      <div class="sc-fill"></div>
      <a href="/loom/manual/">MANUAL</a>
      <a href="/loom/version">VERSIONS</a>
      <a href="/blog/">BLOG</a>
      <a href="mailto:support@moonquakemedia.com">SUPPORT</a>
    </div>
  </div>

</main>
